  <value name="node_comment">Converts a given date which of type java.lang.String and converts it into an instance of java.util.Date by using
the pattern input parameter, e.g. yyyyMMdd. 
 
@param stringDate - the given date of type java.lang.String.
@param datePattern - the pattern of the given string to which it is compliant. It must not be &lt;code&gt;null&lt;code&gt;.

@return Returns the date object to which the given string was converted using the pattern. If given data 
	was &lt;code&gt;null&lt;code&gt; then &lt;code&gt;null&lt;code&gt; is returned.

@throw ServiceExcpetion - thrown if the given pattern of date is &lt;code&gt;null&lt;code&gt; or if the given date could not
			  be parsed for any reason.


/** Change History **/
13.09.2011: $RADE: Change History added
02.09.2014: $RADE: Issue #58088 : Allow other values.</value>
